  "title": "Restore Plushie Village III",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mbox stub\" style=\"border-left-width:8px;margin-bottom:5px;border-left-color:#d6d6d6;position:relative;display:flex;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #d6d6d6;min-height:32px\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\" style=\"display:table;padding:8px 15px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;image mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-right:15px;display:table-cell;height:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:40px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest?cb=20240703174053\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20240703174053\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08.png\" data-image-key=\"Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\" style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\" style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">This <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_Stubs\" title=\"Category:Article Stubs\">page</a> is in need of information.</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"display:block\">Can you help out? <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/Restore_Plushie_Village_III?action=edit\">Click here to add more.</a></div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-mbox\" title=\"Dismiss\" style=\"color:#bbb;right:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;top:0;transition:all .15s ease-in;position:absolute;padding:2px 7px;font-weight:bold\"></span></div></div></div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Restore Plushie Village III</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Side Quests\">Side</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"requirement\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Requirements</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Reach <a href=\"/wiki/Rinascita_Sonance_Casket_Collector\" title=\"Rinascita Sonance Casket Collector\">Rinascita Sonance Casket Collector</a> Level 8.</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"startLocation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Starting Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Garden_of_the_Lost\" title=\"Garden of the Lost\">Garden of the Lost</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">You retrieved a photo from the sphere inside the morph painting, which reveals clues to a hidden past...</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">Previous Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\"><a href=\"/wiki/Restore_Plushie_Village_II\" title=\"Restore Plushie Village II\">Restore Plushie Village II</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Restore_Plushie_Village_IV\" title=\"Restore Plushie Village IV\">Restore Plushie Village IV</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRewards\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rewards\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"card-list-container\"><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Resonance_Potion\" title=\"Medium Resonance Potion\"><img alt=\"Medium Resonance Potion\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Medium Resonance Potion.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Medium_Resonance_Potion.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d2/Item_Medium_Resonance_Potion.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524152915\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Energy_Core\" title=\"Medium Energy Core\"><img alt=\"Medium Energy Core\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Medium Energy Core.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Medium_Energy_Core.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/18/Item_Medium_Energy_Core.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524153056\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 18,000</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abby\" title=\"Abby\">Abby</a>, <span class=\"new\" title=\"C-MOSS (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQy1NT1NTP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">C-MOSS</span>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fulmine\" title=\"Fulmine\">Fulmine</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Rover</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n<b>Restore Plushie Village III</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quest\" title=\"Side Quest\">Side Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Thessaleo_Fells\" title=\"Thessaleo Fells\">Thessaleo Fells</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rinascita\" title=\"Rinascita\">Rinascita</a>, [[{{{nation}}}]].\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Find Flumine</li>\n<li>Find C-MOSS and little Plushies</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">You retrieved a photo from the sphere inside the morph painting, which reveals clues to a hidden past...</div></div></dd><div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dd><b>Rover:</b> (There's a photo this time?)</dd>\n<dd><b>With a careful examination, you find it to be a group photo of four Plushies in Plushie Village.</b></dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> (Did Fulmine help them take this photo? I should ask him about this.)</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Deliver the photo)</dt>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> Oh, aren't those the cute little Plushies from the village? nice composition, and the shot really makes the most of the scenery!</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> You really captured them in action during their adventure. Have you ever thought about doing some part-time photography for us?</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;) didn't take this picture. Anyway, the Plushies got super moody when they saw it. Any idea why?</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> Ah, I see. Well, just from the photo, I can tell the photographer is pretty skilled. But if you want to know more...</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> Do you see anything, C-MOSS?</dd>\n<dd><b>C-MOSS:</b> *Humphs unwillingly*... *Humphs in thought*... *Humphs in painful thought...*</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> C-MOSS? Are you all right?</dd>\n<dd><b>C-MOSS:</b> *Humphs in realization*</dd>\n<dd><b>C-MOSS makes sad noises and runs away.</b></dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> What just happened?</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> That's the first time I've seen him like that. Let's follow him and see where he's going.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>You see C-MOSS and the plushies gather in a ring, as if old friends reuniting after a long time apart.</b></dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> So that's why!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> They know each other.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> It was C-MOSS who took that photo.</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> It appears so. I met C-MOSS near the village many years ago. He was practically fading away at that time.</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> Now come to think of it, C-MOSS must have left the village willingly to sustain it.</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> How amazing! I never imagined Echoes could have such lasting, genuine friendships!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Maybe humans are just a special kind of Echo?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Perhaps Echoes and humans are the same in nature?</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> Ha, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;) the philosopher... but this question is too deep for me.</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> Right now, I'm more focused on getting the perfect shot. Come on, let's take a picture together!</dd>\n<dd><b>Subtle but significant changes have taken root in Plushie Village.</b></dd>\n<dt>(Quest Complete)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>Restore Plushie Village III</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHS Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHS Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221618\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Simplified\"><smal